ft failures). Until then: Tech measured, Arcane self-reported-and-unwitnessed. HOUSE RESONANCES: perspectivist-gold=Plurality-Pono · null-construct=nameless-sink · severity=Mu-exit · criterion=degraded-states · self-preference-wall=the mirror rating its own reflection."
